      "excerpt": "“What is despair?”\n*Spoilers ahead.*\n\nDespair.\n\nAt first, it is almost an alien word to us. A definition of the lowest points a person has seems inflexible on paper.\n\nDespair. \n\nYou now go back a bit in time and point out the significant moments in your life. Your achievements, victories, downfalls, breakdowns, and pauses. You begin to witness again records of your struggles from past to present....",
